title: ItemVendorApple
---

<<if inventory_count("apple") < 10>>
    <<add_inventory_item apple>>
<<else>>
    Player: That's too many apples.
<<endif>>

===
title: ItemVendorOrange
---
<<if inventory_count("orange") < 10>>
    <<add_inventory_item orange>>
<<else>>
    Player: I've already got enough oranges.
<<endif>>

===
title: ItemVendorBlueberry
---
<<if inventory_count(FoodType.Blueberry) < 10>>
    <<add_inventory_item blueberry>>
<<else>>
    Player: I don't need that many blueberries.
<<endif>>

===